# Client build + planning (Graphify + Floorplan) — ZTE-015

Runbook: `docs/CLIENT_BUILD_PLANNING.md`

## Setup (Mac / MSI)

- [ ] `./scripts/planning-tools-setup.sh`
- [ ] `graphify install` for Cursor + Claude
- [ ] Floorplan plugin in Claude Code (`floorplan@floorplan`)

## New client

- [ ] PRD in vault `brain/clients/<slug>/` (no secrets)
- [ ] Floorplan **blueprint** from PRD
- [ ] GCP client project stub in Notion VM Registry (Provider: Google Cloud)
- [ ] Agreement on what ships in git vs Drive only

## During build

- [ ] After major PR: `/graphify .` → review `GRAPH_REPORT.md`
- [ ] "Update the floorplan" after milestone
- [ ] Floorplan Health check before staging
- [ ] `agent-work-archive.sh` → Stud-Bot-Depo

## Handoff

- [ ] Export floorplan HTML (client-safe)
- [ ] Sanitized graph report only (no env paths with keys)
- [ ] Mark ZTE-015 done